        "Abstract": "We introduce mWoZ, a multilingual task-oriented dialog dataset created by translating 2,000 dialogs from the English MultiWOZ 2.1 dataset into Arabic, Chinese, German, and Russian. mWoZ serves as a benchmark for evaluating cross-lingual transfer for task-oriented dialog systems. We provide extensive experiments on cross-lingual transfer for dialog state tracking (DST) and response retrieval (RR) tasks, demonstrating the challenges and potential of multilingual transfer in task-oriented dialog systems."
